# Jinx chrome

- **Every** toolbar, activity-bar, tree, tab, menu, and overlay glyph is Font Awesome via `create_activity_icon` / `icon_button` (`qtawesome`, baked pixmap). Do not ship Unicode dingbats (`▾`, `▸`, `×`), Qt standard pixmaps, or one-off painted icons except traffic lights and the Jinx orb.
- Map a new kind in `jinx_ai/icon.py` `_KIND_FA` when you add a control. Unknown kinds must not silently become a circle in the shipping UI.
- Compact **on/off** controls are `IconToggle` (or the same pattern): one FA glyph, **green `#28c840` when on**, **red `#ff5f57` with the slash/off variant when off**. Speech = `volume-up` / `volume-mute`. Call = `phone` / `phone-slash`. Mic mute (during a call) = `microphone` / `microphone-slash`. Never put a `ToggleSwitch` on a toolbar, chat bar, or host header.
- `SwitchRow` stays only for labeled Settings preference rows (title + subtitle).
- Traffic lights stay Apple circles. Overlay Close stays the FA `times` HUD button.
